    <string name="gain_auto">Auto (recommended)</string>
    <string name="setting_gain_help">Auto measures the signal when you tune, keeps adjusting while you listen, and remembers what worked for each station. With a manual gain, open the signal details and keep Peak below about −3 dBFS; higher MER is better.</string>
